---
description: Snow UI governance rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Before making UI changes, read the Snow UI governance files. Use Snow design tokens only. Do not create one-off colors or shadows.

AI Companion must follow Open LLM VTuber structure: settings panel, 2D character stage, connection status, subtitle overlay, bottom control bar. Chat history is secondary.

Child screens must be low-density, large-touch, and gentle. Parent screens may be denser but must use observational language only.
